    <Section>Main</Section>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305072</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_001Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>探したぞ！　&lt;Klarth&gt;！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, there you
are! &lt;Klarth&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305160</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>探したのはこっちだ、
まったく……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm the one who's
been looking for
you... *grumble*</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305248</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>はぁはぁ……
突然、駆け出すから……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>*pant* *pant* You
ran off...so suddenly...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305316</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>んだよ、もう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Come the hell on...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305384</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>君たちも来たか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You two are
here, too, huh.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305576</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_006Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なるほど……
『虹輪』を消すために
精霊の力が必要、か……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, I see... So you need
the spirits to get rid of
a Prism Ring? Hmm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305576</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_007Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>だったら、
例えば精霊晶核（アトミスムコア）を
使う、とかかな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>In that case, you should
be able to use the
spirits' Atomic Cores.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305644</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんだ、それ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305728</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_009Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>精霊の力の源になってる物質さ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a form of matter
which serves as the
source of the spirits' powers.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305896</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>やっぱり、そいつしかないか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So they really will
need those, huh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>305896</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>この子たちに
『エレメンツポット』を
ひとつ分けてやってくれないか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Could you give
these kids one of
your "Elemental Pots"?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306004</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_012Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>お安い御用だ、親友の頼みとあらばな。
何でも言ってくれ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That's a simple enough favor,
if it's for a good friend.
Whatever you need, just ask!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306144</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_013Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おまえがまた
戻ってきてくれて
よかったよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I'm just happy
you're back to
your old self, really.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306144</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_014Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>また一緒に
研究できるな！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Now we can do some
more research together!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306204</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_015&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ふん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmph...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306292</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_016Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それじゃあ、
これ……君たちに……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Well, then... This
is for you two...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306352</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_017&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>サンキュ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Thanks.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306456</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_018Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>それを持って、
精霊から精霊晶核を
受け取ればいい</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You just need to have this
with you when you collect
the spirits' Atomic Cores.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306520</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>精霊かぁ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The spirits, huh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306624</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_020Z&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あと、エレメンツポットは
壊れやすいから気をつけてね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Also, the Elemental Pot
is quite fragile, so be
careful with it, okay?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306704</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_021&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あ、ああ、うん。
わかったよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Ah, yeah,
sure. Got it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306768</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_022&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>イフリート！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Efreet!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306864</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>イフリート。
おまえの精霊晶核を分けてくれ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Efreet. Give us
your Atomic Core.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>306928</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>承知した</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>As you wish.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>5</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307012</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>おぉっ……！
これが精霊晶核！？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whoa...! *This*
is an Atomic Core!?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>25</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307092</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Dio&gt;、はしゃぎすぎ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...You don't need
to get *that*
excited, &lt;Dio&gt;...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307256</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_027&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よし、それじゃあ
&lt;Red&gt;ローンヴァレイ&lt;White&gt;に行くとしよう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright. Well, then, let's
head for &lt;Red&gt;Lone Valley&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307256</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_028&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Red&gt;ユークリッド&lt;White&gt;の東側にある
風の強い谷だ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's a valley with
strong winds, just
to the east of &lt;Red&gt;Euclid&lt;White&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307352</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_029&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>風……
そこに風の精霊シルフが
いるんですね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Winds... So the
spirit of Wind,
Sylph, is there.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307468</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_030&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ。私も最後まで
君たちに付き合おう。
協力すると言ったからな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. I'll come with you
until you're all done. I did
say I would help, after all.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>30</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307556</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_031&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よし、
&lt;Red&gt;ローンヴァレイ&lt;White&gt;に出発だ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Alright. Let's set
off, for &lt;Red&gt;Lone Valley&lt;White&gt;!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307664</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_032&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;、気をつけて。
転んでエレメンツポット
割っちゃうよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Be careful, &lt;Dio&gt;. If
you trip, you'll break
the Elemental Pot.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307752</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_033&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>全然だいじょーぶ。
気ぃつけてるって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, it's perfectly fine.
I'm being careful, 100%.</EnglishText>
      <Notes>not sure on line delivery here, will need it tested in-context</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>33</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>307816</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_050_070_034&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>んもう……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nnngh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>going for a "struggling to bite her tongue" feel but not sure if it comes
across right, see what you think</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <Status>Problematic</Status>
    </Entry>
